{"id": "69020", "title": "残渣余孽", "author": "方子飞", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 30, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/69/69020.htm", "intro": "脆弱,堕落,废柴,一无是处之人，人见人欺――最后死而后生,成为人之王者-――一个是脆弱，堕落，废柴，一个是强大，无敌，名震天下的杀手之王他们会是同一个人吗？", "base": "files/article/html/69/69020", "chapters": [{"title": "第1章：废柴", "file": "10555082.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2章：重生", "file": "10555083.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3章：黑邦份子", "file": "10555084.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4章：美女警察", "file": "10555085.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5章：寻找雇佣兵", "file": "10555086.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6章：相遇黑邦份子", "file": "10555087.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7章：蒙面黑衣人", "file": "10555088.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8章：弱不禁风的人", "file": "10555089.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9章：原来是你这个滚蛋", "file": "10555090.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10章：可恨的滚蛋", "file": "10555091.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11章：讨厌的清洁工", "file": "10555092.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12章：强大的蒙面黑衣人", "file": "10555093.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13章：继续查找", "file": "10555094.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14章：真的是吓死我了", "file": "10555095.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15章：喜欢女人的人", "file": "10555096.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16章：不简单的清洁工", "file": "10555097.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17章：纠缠不休", "file": "10555098.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18章：危险", "file": "10555099.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19章：蒙面黑衣人", "file": "10555100.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20章：揍他一顿", "file": "10555101.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21章：快点找到无影", "file": "10555102.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22章：无计可施", "file": "10555103.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23章：模样", "file": "10555104.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24章：傻子清洁工", "file": "10555105.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25章